<title>USA: Mount Pleasant CSD, Iowa, won by Wm R. Hough.</title>
<headline>Mount Pleasant CSD, Iowa, won by Wm R. Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R. Hough &amp; Co., said it won $4.530 million of Mount Pleasant CSD, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.623 percent.</p>
